0;• Data SOPd (/data/excel-sopd - Referensi Order)&#10;• Input Target Penjadwalan JHP &amp; Target Harian&#10;• Realisasi JHP (Web &amp; Bot) + Laporan Pekerjaan" style="rounded=1;arcSize=18;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shadow=1;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;strokeWidth=2;fillColor=#fff7ed;strokeColor=#ea580c;fontColor=#7c2d12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="880" y="230" width="500" height="130" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="p_4_0" value="4.0 KALKULASI BIAYA &amp; SIMULASI PRICELIST&#10;&#10;• Simulator Pricelist (20+ Kategori Produk Cetak)&#10;• Perhitungan HPP Cetak (/hpp-kalkulasi)&#10;• Sinkronisasi Bahan Baku dari Order Produksi&#10;• Referensi Tarif dari Rekap Pembelian Barang" style="rounded=1;arcSize=18;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shadow=1;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;strokeWidth=2;fillColor=#faf5ff;strokeColor=#9333ea;fontColor=#581c87;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1420" y="230" width="360" height="130" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="p_5_0" value="5.0 AKUNTANSI, SDM &amp; TATA KELOLA&#10;&#10;• Scrape Jurnal Umum &amp; Rek Akuntansi&#10;• Dashboard Akunting (Grafik Kas &amp; Tren Laba-Rugi)&#10;• Upload Karyawan &amp; Catat Kesalahan&#10;• Manajemen Akun Pengguna, RBAC &amp; Audit Log" style="rounded=1;arcSize=18;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shadow=1;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;strokeWidth=2;fillColor=#f0fdfa;strokeColor=#0d9488;fontColor=#134e4a;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1820" y="230" width="360" height="130" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="ds_d1" value="D1 | Data Pembelian Digit&#10;(purchase_requests, spph_out, sph_in, purchase_orders, penerimaan_pembelian, rekap_pembelian_barang, pelunasan_hutang)" style="shape=partialRectangle;top=0;bottom=0;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=9.5;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1